{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_234_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_234","textTraditional":"一、六年，春，城邾瑕。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_234_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_234","textTraditional":"二、晉趙鞅帥師伐鮮虞。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_234_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_234","textTraditional":"三、吳伐陳。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_234_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_234","textTraditional":"四、夏，齊國夏及高張來奔。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_234_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_234","textTraditional":"五、叔還會吳於柤。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_234_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_234","textTraditional":"六、秋，七月，庚寅，楚子軫卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_234_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_234","textTraditional":"七、齊陽生入於齊。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_234_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_234","textTraditional":"八、齊陳乞弒其君荼。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_234_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_234","textTraditional":"陽生入而弒其君，以陳乞主之何也？不以陽生君荼也，其不以陽生君荼何也？陽生正，荼不正。不正則其曰君何也？荼雖不正，已受命矣。入者，內弗受也。荼不正，何用弗受？以其受命，可以言弗受也。陽生其以國氏何也？取國於荼也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_234_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_234","textTraditional":"九、冬，仲孫何忌帥師伐邾。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_234_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_234","textTraditional":"十、宋向巢帥師伐曹。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}